== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Gives Isaac one empty [[Heart container]].
* {{dlc|r}} Gives Isaac one full [[Heart container]].
* {{dlc|nr}} +0.3 [[damage]].
* {{dlc|r}} +1 [[damage]].
* {{dlc|nr}} +0.25 [[range]].
* {{dlc|r}} +1.5 [[range]].
* {{dlc|nr}} +0.5 [[tear falling speed]].
* {{dlc|nr}} -0.1 [[speed]].
* {{dlc|r}} -0.2 [[speed]].
* Makes Isaac's head larger, which on its own is only a visual effect.
** If taken when Isaac is smaller than the default, this Mushroom also increases his hitbox slightly.
* {{transformation contribution|Fun Guy}}

== Notes ==
* There are two collectible items in the game named [[Odd Mushroom]]; you can tell them apart from the sprites, or in the case of {{curse|blind}}, by looking at the change in Isaac's stats (usually health is the most noticeable).

== Interactions ==
* {{i|The Virus|nr}}: The speed down from the Virus does not stack with the Odd Mushroom; if both are collected, only a total of -0.1 applies.

